license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A GitHub template for developing HBR-style MBA case studies from digital
  sources using agentic AI tools, with a verification-first workflow:
  source quality tiers, go/no-go assessment gates, verification-debt
  tracking, and seven automated quality checks. Developed for ITEC-617 at
  American University's Kogod School of Business.
keywords:
  - case method
  - business education
  - agentic AI
  - verification
  - MBA teaching
